<title>USA: Echostar wins Spanish contract.</title>
<headline>Echostar wins Spanish contract.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Echostar International Corp on Monday said it won a contract worth more than $40 million to provide digital set-top boxes to a unit of Telefonica de Espana SA.</p>
<p>Telefonica's Distribuidora de Television Digital SA unit ordered 100,000 boxes as part of the introduction of its satellite television service this September, Echostar said.</p>
<p>Echostar said it would license its proprietary electronic programming guide to Distribuidora.</p>
